---
import { productExternalUrl, site } from '../config/site';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-border px-5 pb-20 pt-14 sm:px-8 sm:pb-24 sm:pt-20 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-24">
  <div class="container-nexo">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.06fr_0.94fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-20">
      <div class="reveal relative z-10" style="--index: 0">
        <p class="eyebrow">Software para operaciones administrativas</p>

        <h1 class="heading-display mt-7 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(3.25rem,6vw,5.75rem)] font-medium">
          Si el proceso vive entre Excel, mails y un ERP, <span class="text-blue">ahí trabajamos.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-xl">
          {site.name} releva el trabajo real, conecta las herramientas que ya usa el equipo y
          construye lo que falta. Sin empezar por una plataforma ni forzar IA donde no aporta.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#contacto" class="btn-primary">
            Revisar un proceso
            <span class="btn-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#productos" class="btn-secondary">
            Ver el caso constanci.ar
            <span class="btn-arrow btn-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true">↓</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 max-w-2xl border-l-2 border-blue pl-5">
          <p class="font-mono text-[0.64rem] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">Qué cambia</p>
          <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink sm:text-base">
            La información deja de copiarse entre herramientas, cada estado tiene un responsable
            y el equipo puede reconstruir qué pasó.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="hero-flow reveal relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[35rem]" style="--index: 1">
        <div class="border border-border bg-surface p-5 shadow-[14px_14px_0_var(--color-blue-soft)] sm:p-7">
          <figcaption class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border pb-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-[0.64rem] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-muted">Un caso propio</span>
            <a
              href={productExternalUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue hover:underline"
            >
              constanci.ar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </figcaption>

          <div class="flow-file mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 border border-border bg-canvas p-4">
            <span class="flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center bg-blue font-mono text-xs font-medium text-white">XLS</span>
            <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <p class="truncate text-sm font-semibold text-ink">lote_cuits.xlsx</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-muted">Una lista, sin cargar cada CUIT por separado</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="relative mt-6 pl-2">
            <span class="flow-rail absolute bottom-7 left-[1.35rem] top-7 w-px origin-top bg-blue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <ol class="space-y-1">
              <li class="flow-step relative grid grid-cols-[2.25rem_1fr] gap-4 py-3" style="--flow-index: 0">
                <span class="flow-node relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-blue/30 bg-surface font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-blue">01</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Leer la planilla</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Detectar CUITs y errores de formato.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flow-step relative grid grid-cols-[2.25rem_1fr] gap-4 py-3" style="--flow-index: 1">
                <span class="flow-node relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-blue/30 bg-surface font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-blue">02</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Consultar AFIP</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Obtener cada constancia pública en PDF.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flow-step relative grid grid-cols-[2.25rem_1fr] gap-4 py-3" style="--flow-index: 2">
                <span class="flow-node relative z-10 flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-blue/30 bg-surface font-mono text-[0.65rem] text-blue">03</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Preparar la entrega</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Ordenar los documentos dentro de un ZIP.</p>
                </div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-border pt-4 text-xs text-muted">
            <span>Sin instalar software</span>
            <span>Sin clave fiscal</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
